Package: MoCaHelp
Title: Helper Code for MoCaSeq pipeline
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcus", "Wagner", email = "marcus.wagner@tum.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-9421-6766"))
Description: This package provides standard functions for downstram analyses of MoCaSeq.
    It includes loading and wrangling data from MoCaSeq output, getting some metadata,
    and loading smaller reference genome data (e.g. centromere regions).
